#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kde; provides a list of all the X.509 certificates used by the system. They "
"can be accessed in the <guilabel>SSL Preferences</guilabel> module in "
"&systemsettings;."
msgstr ""
"&kde; obezbjeđuje listu svih X.509 certifikata korištenih od strane sistema. "
"Njima možete pristupiti iz <guilabel>SSL Postavke</guilabel> modula u "
"&systemsettings;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This module provides a categorized listing of all SSL versions and "
"certificates. You can see the details of each of the certificates and add, "
"delete, disable, or enable them."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul obezbjeđuje kategorizirani listing svih SSL verzija i "
"certifikata. Možete vidjeti detalje svih certifikata, i dodati, ukloniti, "
"omogućiti ili onemogućiti ih."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The certificates are categorized into <guilabel>System certificates</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>User-added certificates</guilabel>. The "
"<guilabel>System certificates</guilabel> are further categorized by the "
"organization that issued them."
msgstr ""
"Certifikati su podijeljeni u <guilabel>Sistemski certifikati</guilabel> i "
"<guilabel>Korisnički dodani certifikati</guilabel>. <guilabel>Sistemski "
"certifikati</guilabel> su dalje podijeljeni u kategorije prema organizaciji "
"koja ih je izdala."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "The SSL Versions and Certificates Module"
msgstr "SSL Verzija i modul certifikata"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "The SSL Versions and Certificates module."
msgstr "SSL Verzija i modul certifikata."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Viewing the Details of a Certificate</title>"
msgstr "<title>Pregled detalja certifikata</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select a certificate under a listed organization, and click on the "
"<guibutton>Display</guibutton> underneath the list to view the details of "
"the certificate."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite certifikat pod izlistanom organizacijom, i kliknite na dugme "
"<guibutton>Prikaži</guibutton> ispod liste da vidite detalje o certifikatu."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Viewing the Details of a Certificate</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Pregled detalja certifikata</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "The certificate details window."
msgstr "Prozor detalja certifikata."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enabling or Disabling a Certificate"
msgstr "Omogućavanje ili onemogućavanje certifikata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First, select a certificate listed under an organization. Then, click the "
"<guibutton>Enable</guibutton> button to enable the certificate, or click the "
"<guibutton>Disable</guibutton> button to disable an enabled certificate."
msgstr ""
"Prvo odaberite certifikat izlistan pod organizacijom. Onda kliknite na dugme "
"<guibutton>Omogući</guibutton> da omogućite certifikat, ili "
"<guibutton>Onemogući</guibutton> da ga onemogućite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can enable or disable a certificate by selecting or "
"clearing the check box before the certificate."
msgstr ""
"Alternativno, možete omogućiti ili onemogućiti certifikat označivanjem ili "
"odznačivanjem kvadratića prije certifikata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can enable or disable multiple certificates by selecting them while "
"holding the &Ctrl; key and then clicking on the <guibutton>Enable</"
"guibutton> or <guibutton>Disable</guibutton> button below the list."
msgstr ""
"Možete omogućiti ili onemogućiti više certifikata birajući ih dok držite "
"tipku &Ctrl; i onda klinuti na  dugme <guibutton>Omogući</guibutton> ili "
"<guibutton>Onemogući</guibutton> ispod liste."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a Certificate"
msgstr "Dodavanje certifikata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First, click on the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button below the certificate "
"list. It will open the file selector dialog allowing you to locate where the "
"certificate files are stored. After locating the certificate file, select it "
"and click on the <guibutton>Open</guibutton> button to add it."
msgstr ""
"Prvo, kliknite na  dugme <guibutton>Dodaj</guibutton> ispod liste "
"certifikata. Otvoret će se okvir za odabir datoteke koji Vam omogućava da "
"locirate gdje su sačuvani dokumenti certifikata. Nakon što locirate "
"datoteku, odaberite je i kliknite na dugme <guibutton>Otvori</guibutton>  da "
"je dodate."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The certificates must be in one of the following formats: <acronym>DER</"
"acronym>, <acronym>PEM</acronym>, or &Netscape;-encoded X.509 certificate."
msgstr ""
"Certifikati moraju biti u jednom od sljedećih formata: <acronym>DER</"
"acronym>, <acronym>PEM</acronym>, ili &Netscape;-kodirani X.509 certifikat."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing a Certificate"
msgstr "Uklanjanje certifikata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the listed certificate that you want to remove, and click the "
"<guibutton>Remove</guibutton> button to remove the certificate."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite iz liste certifikat koji želite ukloniti, i kliknite na dugme "
"<guibutton>Ukloni</guibutton> da biste uklonili certifikat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "System certificates cannot be removed."
msgstr "Sistemski certifikati ne mogu biti uklonjeni."

